{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/seneca/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-practical-philosopher","title":"实践的哲学家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/seneca/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-practical-philosopher","wordCount":2156,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/seneca/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":2303,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"综合评价\">综合评价</h1><p>本章在客观审视争议的基础上，对塞内卡做出全面的综合评价。一方面，充分肯定他作为&quot;实践的哲学家&quot;的卓越贡献与深刻智慧；另一方面，也客观地正视围绕其人生的争议，并珍视其哲学之&quot;言&quot;的独立价值。两篇文档，分别呈现实践的哲学家，以及一个全面而辩证的评判。</p>\n"}